---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import existingProjects from '../data/projects.json';
const projects = [{
  slug: 'project-demo',
  title: '在研FPS手游',
  desc: '在研FPS手游的三段视频演示。',
  category: 'game',
  tags: ['Game', 'Skill'],
  cover: '/assets/fps-mobile-cover.png',
}, ...existingProjects];
---
<Layout><section class="hero"><div class="hero-copy"><p class="eyebrow"><span class="status-dot"></span> GAME DEVELOPER / TOOL BUILDER</p><h1>让想法成为游戏，<br/>让创作<span class="accent">更进一步。</span></h1><p class="hero-desc">我是 Eric Chen，一名热爱游戏的开发者。<br/>用代码构建游戏体验，也为创作者打造更顺手的工具。</p><div class="hero-actions"><a class="button" href="#work">探索我的作品 <span>↘</span></a><a class="text-link" href="https://github.com/chao57" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">GitHub ↗</a></div><div class="stack"><span>C++</span><span>Python</span><span>Unreal Engine 5</span><span>Unity</span></div></div><div class="hero-art" aria-hidden="true"><div class="orbit orbit-one"></div><div class="orbit orbit-two"></div><div class="cross c1">+</div><div class="cross c2">+</div><div class="art-top">CREATIVE ENGINEERING <span>001</span></div><div class="cube"><div class="cube-face front">&lt;/&gt;</div><div class="cube-face back"></div></div><div class="art-bottom"><span>IDEA → CODE → PLAY</span><span class="art-signal">▂ ▄ ▆ █</span></div></div></section>
<section id="work" class="work"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">01 / SELECTED WORK</p><h2>项目与作品<span class="accent">.</span></h2></div><p>从游戏体验，到创作工具。</p></div><div class="filters" role="group" aria-label="按项目类型筛选"><button class="active" data-filter="all" aria-pressed="true">全部项目 <span>{projects.length.toString().padStart(2,'0')}</span></button><button data-filter="tool" aria-pressed="false">工具与管线</button><button data-filter="game" aria-pressed="false">游戏开发</button></div><div class="project-grid">{projects.map((p,i)=><a class="project-card" href={'/projects/'+p.slug+'/'} data-category={p.category}><div class="project-image"><img src={p.cover} alt={p.title} loading={i<2?'eager':'lazy'}/><span class="project-index">{(i+1).toString().padStart(2,'0')}</span><span class="project-arrow">↗</span></div><div class="project-meta"><span>{p.category==='game'?'GAME DEVELOPMENT':'TOOLS & PIPELINE'}</span><span>{p.tags.slice(0,3).join(' / ')}</span></div><h3>{p.title}</h3><p>{p.desc}</p></a>)}</div></section>
<section id="about" class="about"><div><p class="eyebrow">02 / ABOUT ME</p><h2>玩家，也是<br/><span class="accent">创造者。</span></h2></div><div class="about-copy"><p>我毕业于东北大学数字媒体技术专业，曾在腾讯、友塔游戏、听潮阁工作，主要从事偏工具向的游戏开发。</p><p>游戏是我的工作，也是我的热爱。业余时间，我参与 Game Jam 和独立游戏项目，在不同的玩法与技术之间持续探索。</p><div class="experience"><span>游戏开发</span><span>开发工具</span><span>美术生产管线</span></div></div></section>
<section id="contact" class="contact"><p class="eyebrow">03 / GET IN TOUCH</p><h2>一起创造下一段<span class="accent">体验。</span></h2><p>欢迎交流游戏开发、工具制作与工作机会。</p><a class="email-link" href="mailto:1924525314@qq.com">1924525314@qq.com <span>↗</span></a><a class="text-link" href="https://github.com/chao57" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">GitHub / chao57 ↗</a></section></Layout>
<script>const buttons=document.querySelectorAll<HTMLButtonElement>('[data-filter]');buttons.forEach(button=>button.addEventListener('click',()=>{buttons.forEach(b=>{b.classList.toggle('active',b===button);b.setAttribute('aria-pressed',String(b===button));});document.querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>('[data-category]').forEach(card=>{card.hidden=button.dataset.filter!=='all'&&card.dataset.category!==button.dataset.filter;});}));</script>


